<li>Invoice start number</li>
</ul>

<h3>Invoice Settings</h3>
<ul>
<li>HSN/SAC code (default: 997319)</li>
<li>Default payment terms (e.g., 30 days)</li>
<li>Terms of delivery</li>
<li>Default CGST, SGST percentages</li>
<li>Whether to add GST by default</li>
