<li>Default CGST, SGST, IGST percentages</li>
</ul>

<h3>Language</h3>
<ul>
<li>Switch between English and Telugu</li>
</ul>
</div>

<!-- 8. MULTI-LANGUAGE -->
<div class="section-break">
<h2>8. Multi-Language Support</h2>
<p>
The entire system supports two languages:
</p>
<ul>
<li><b>English</b> &mdash; Full interface in English</li>
<li><b>Telugu</b> (&#3108;&#3142;&#3122;&#3137;&#3108;&#3149;&#3122;&#3137;) &mdash; Full interface in Telugu</li>
</ul>
<p>
Users can switch languages instantly with a single click from the top navigation bar.
The language preference is remembered across sessions.
</p>
</div>

<!-- 9. SECURITY -->
<div class="section-break">
<h2>9. Security &amp; User Roles</h2>

<h3>User Authentication</h3>
<ul>
<li>Secure login with username and password</li>
<li>Passwords are securely hashed and stored (never in plain text)</li>
<li>Session management with automatic logout</li>
</ul>

<h3>Role-Based Access</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Role</th><th>Access Level</th></tr>
<tr><td>Admin</td><td>Full access to all features including delete operations, user management, and settings</td></tr>
<tr><td>Manager</td><td>Access to most operations and reports, but cannot delete records or manage users</td></tr>
<tr><td>Operator</td><td>Limited access to daily operations like trip entry, diesel entry, and attendance</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Data Security</h3>
<ul>
<li>All data is stored in a secure, cloud-based PostgreSQL database (Supabase)</li>
<li>Row-level security policies ensure users can only access data they are authorized for</li>
<li>All communication between the app and the database is encrypted (HTTPS/TLS)</li>
<li>Soft deletes &mdash; records are marked as cancelled rather than permanently deleted, preserving audit trails</li>
</ul>
</div>

<!-- 10. TECHNOLOGY -->
<div class="section-break">
<h2>10. Technology &amp; Infrastructure</h2>

<h3>Frontend</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>React</b> &mdash; Modern, fast, component-based user interface</li>
<li><b>TypeScript</b> &mdash; Type-safe code for reliability and fewer bugs</li>
<li><b>Tailwind CSS</b> &mdash; Responsive, mobile-friendly design that works on all screen sizes</li>
<li><b>Vite</b> &mdash; Lightning-fast build tool for instant page loads</li>
</ul>

<h3>Backend &amp; Database</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Supabase (PostgreSQL)</b> &mdash; Enterprise-grade, cloud-hosted database</li>
<li><b>Real-time updates</b> &mdash; Dashboard and data update automatically as new entries are made</li>
<li><b>Row-Level Security (RLS)</b> &mdash; Database-level security policies</li>
<li><b>Automated backups</b> &mdash; Database is backed up automatically by the cloud provider</li>
</ul>

<h3>Deployment</h3>
<ul>
<li>Cloud-hosted &mdash; accessible from any device with a web browser</li>
<li>Responsive design &mdash; works on desktop, tablet, and mobile</li>
<li>No installation required &mdash; just open in a browser</li>
</ul>
</div>

<!-- 11. ROADMAP -->
<div class="section-break">
