<li><b>Customer Portal</b> &mdash; Self-service portal for customers to view their invoices and payment history</li>
<li><b>Automated Recurring Invoices</b> &mdash; Auto-generate monthly invoices for contract customers</li>
<li><b>Expense Management</b> &mdash; Track additional business expenses beyond diesel and maintenance</li>
<li><b>Document Management</b> &mdash; Upload and store vehicle documents (RC, insurance, fitness, permits)</li>
<li><b>Driver Performance Analytics</b> &mdash; Track driver hours, trip counts, and productivity metrics</li>
<li><b>Multi-Company Support</b> &mdash; Manage multiple business entities from a single system</li>
</ul>

<div class="feature-box">
<h4>Summary</h4>
<p>
The Crane &amp; JCB ERP System is a complete, production-ready business management platform that
handles every aspect of crane and JCB rental operations. From the moment a vehicle leaves for a
job to the moment payment is received, every transaction is tracked, calculated, and reported.
The system eliminates manual paperwork, reduces billing errors, provides real-time business
visibility, and scales as the business grows.
</p>
</div>

